                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="careers-area inner-style">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center title">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="careers-content">
                    <h4 class="mb-3">Careers at Titan Technology</h4>
                    <p>Join Our Team and Shape the Future of Technology At Titan Technology, we believe in empowering our people to grow and innovate. We are constantly looking for talented individuals who are passionate about technology, eager to learn, and ready to make a difference.Join Our Team and Shape the Future of Technology At Titan Technology, we believe in empowering our people to grow and innovate. We are constantly looking for talented individuals who are passionate about technology, eager to learn, and ready to make a difference.</p>
                   
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <img src="~/assets/images/inner-images/blog-details-benifis-thumb-1.png"></img>
                @* <div class="careers-desc">
                    <p>Join Our Team and Shape the Future of Technology At Titan Technology, we believe in empowering our people to grow and innovate. We are constantly looking for talented individuals who are passionate about technology, eager to learn, and ready to make a difference.Join Our Team and Shape the Future of Technology At Titan Technology, we believe in empowering our people to grow and innovate. We are constantly looking for talented individuals who are passionate about technology, eager to learn, and ready to make a difference.</p>
                </div> *@
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-bottom border-3 my-4" style="border-color:#3366cc;"></div>
